// "bosch dishwasher e25" (700). Brand sniper. Anchors: E24 = drain-path blocked, E25 = drain
// pump/impeller/cover (bosch-home.com). HARD split from E15 (base-pan LEAK, separate page) —
// mutual links both ways. Bosch owner-safe includes checking the pump-cover/impeller per Bosch's
// own E24 content. CA air-gap check. Safe DIY = filter/pump-cover-impeller-check/hose/disposal/
// air gap; pump replacement + electrical = tech. $89 residential.

